                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "vice",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f2fd57-6249-3cda-a767-3e6b22fd7457",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bad or immoral behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abe53fc0-f686-4b4d-b326-9e32f5ca88b3",
                                                "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                                "text": "Pride is a vice, not a virtue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efd0dd0d-8a85-4840-a8b8-0001ecb0f7b1",
                                                "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                                "text": "Smoking was a vice Sally picked up in high school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5285392-3366-421c-9bae-e35181f6997a",
                                                "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                                "text": "Shepard: I wear a lot of hats, Mr. Vargas. Some days I shut down criminals. Some days I defuse nukes. Some days I like to enjoy private vices. You understand me?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f813c0f-f1b4-4b4e-a04b-8b7d3458effe",
                                                "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                                "text": "It's a rush you can't deny / A little violence is the ultimate drug / Let's get high / You've been powerless to your vices / Self-control defies you"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24141d16-384d-4d57-bfe4-a2d96737e058",
                                                "sense_id": "7d4c6b1b-c0eb-3dd5-841a-176679ddae52",
                                                "text": "I should not be left to my own devices / they come with prices and vices / I end up in crisis / Tale as old as time"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1780270-eb31-3d94-9ab5-6519390aa72e",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f2fd57-6249-3cda-a767-3e6b22fd7457",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various crimes related (depending on jurisdiction) to weapons, prostitution, pornography, gambling, alcohol, tobacco, or drugs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17931f87-1ef1-3d7e-bcf4-34018a242d88",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f2fd57-6249-3cda-a767-3e6b22fd7457",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clipping of vice squad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "clipping",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "feb71363-d6d3-3fcf-8c6d-f75590b0fd82",
                                        "entry_id": "e9f2fd57-6249-3cda-a767-3e6b22fd7457",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A defect in the temper or behaviour of a horse, such as to make the animal dangerous, to injure its health, or to diminish its usefulness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c624c7fa-2394-4995-88ac-75a5df274278",
                                                "sense_id": "feb71363-d6d3-3fcf-8c6d-f75590b0fd82",
                                                "text": "So a horse with say, navicular disease, making him suitable only for light hacking, would probably be unsound, whereas rearing would be a vice, being a \"defect in the temper... making it dangerous\". A vice can however render a horse unsound - possibly a crib biter will damage its wind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
