                                                "sense_id": "bad00a09-d6ad-36d8-baa0-d59cc05b25fe",
                                                "text": "A very small cab-boy, vice Stoopid retired, swung on behind Foker's vehicle; knock-kneed and in the tightest leather breeches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6049296c-ed6e-4809-9718-420b94e5d734",
                                                "sense_id": "bad00a09-d6ad-36d8-baa0-d59cc05b25fe",
                                                "text": "He was gardener and out-door man, vice Upton, resigned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
